Generate a standalone C reproducer that triggers this vulnerability:

File: testcatalog.c
Line: 69
Function: testRepeatedNextCatalog
Bug type: null-pointer-dereference
CWE: CWE-476
Explanation: xmlDocGetRootElement(doc) can return NULL (e.g., if the catalog dump yields a document without a root element). The next statement dereferences node via node->children without checking for NULL, leading to a crash when the catalog fails to load or produces an empty document.

